{"4762280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MINESTRIKE SURVIVORS", "steam_appid": 4762280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets don't stop coming. Neither do you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MINESTRIKE SURVIVORS throws you into the deep end of the mineshaft and never lets up. Hordes of enemies swarm from every direction and the only thing standing between you and being buried alive is how fast your fingers can move. Type words. Fire shots. Repeat until the screen is clear — or until it isn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a bullet heaven.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character churns out projectiles constantly, the faster you type the more firepower you unleash, and the waves never thin out. They get worse. Chain combos to stack damage, pick up run-shaping upgrades that change how your bullets behave, and push further into the mine than anyone on the global leaderboard has managed before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your keyboard is the trigger. The mine does not forgive slow typists.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type or die.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets don't stop coming. Neither do you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MINESTRIKE SURVIVORS throws you into the deep end of the mineshaft and never lets up. Hordes of enemies swarm from every direction and the only thing standing between you and being buried alive is how fast your fingers can move. Type words. Fire shots. Repeat until the screen is clear — or until it isn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a bullet heaven.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character churns out projectiles constantly, the faster you type the more firepower you unleash, and the waves never thin out. They get worse. Chain combos to stack damage, pick up run-shaping upgrades that change how your bullets behave, and push further into the mine than anyone on the global leaderboard has managed before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your keyboard is the trigger. The mine does not forgive slow typists.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type or die.</p>", "short_description": "Your keyboard is a machine gun. Type words to unleash a storm of bullets, mow down endless waves of mineshaft mobs, and survive as long as your fingers hold out. MINESTRIKE SURVIVORS is a bullet heaven roguelite where every keystroke fires a shot.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4762280/a0c2d28298ba6bf831bd8e6e063a5183fd61a74c/header.jpg?t=1781397904", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4762280/31fbc1f6dfd5b858b495aca01ac907d8e6b4d295/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781397904", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4762280/31fbc1f6dfd5b858b495aca01ac907d8e6b4d295/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781397904", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher, macOS 10.15 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel HD Graphics, AMD equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any standard onboard sound card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Reco